# AuraStream Environment Variables
# Create a copy of this file named ".env" to override these defaults locally.

# The URL of your independently deployed backend proxy server.
# Example: https://my-aurastream-proxy.onrender.com/api/proxy
# If left blank, it defaults to the relative path "/api/proxy" for local development.
# Note for Production Deployment:
# When you build this project for Firebase Hosting (npm run build),
# you must ensure VITE_PROXY_URL is set in your build environment
# so the static dist files point to your live backend server!
